"{\"edits\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the business-cabin award departing SFO at 8:36 a.m. if an earlier Bangkok arrival is your priority. Compared with the other business choice shown, it arrives 4 hours 35 minutes earlier and has a 4 hours 31 minutes shorter elapsed journey, while both list 275,000 Turkish miles and a USD 59 positioning fare quote. Award taxes are unknown, and the search does not establish seat availability or a protected connection.\"}]},{\"start\":6,\"end\":7,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"If you prefer a business-cabin award that arrives at 8:50 a.m., the other business choice uses the same listed 275,000 Turkish miles and USD 59 positioning-fare quote as the earlier-arriving option. You give up the earlier arrival and shorter elapsed journey: it departs four minutes later, has a 7-hour wait at IST rather than 2 hours 20 minutes, and takes 4 hours 31 minutes longer overall. Its Bangkok arrival time matches the economy alternative, but it reports business rather than economy cabin for the award itinerary.\"}]}]}"
